            "name": "Azure Pipelines List run artifacts",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a list of artifacts published by a specific pipeline run. Artifacts include compiled binaries, test results, container images, or any files published using the PublishPipelineArtifact task during pipeline execution.",
